OL,3,ACoroner warns of risk of future deaths
OL,4,Aat mental health unit where patient was
OL,5,Akilled
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt follows a six-day inquest in
OL,8,FSeptember during which the senior
OL,9,Fcoroner for east London, Graeme Irvine,
OL,10,Fconcluded that neglect had more than
OL,11,Ftrivially contributed to Flint Cahan's
OL,12,Fdeath.
